1
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,280
The target has appeared.

2
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:17,840
Are you sure he's alone?

3
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:18,760
Yes.

4
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,400
Mr. Wen is meeting

5
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,320
with some veterans

6
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,520
in the VIP room with Liu Yaru.

7
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:23,760
He won't be in the main hall

8
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,240
for at least ten minutes.

9
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,840
The show begins.

10
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:32,320
Actually,

11
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,800
life is like snooker.

12
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:34,960
Mistake

13
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,600
is the best offense.

14
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:56,880
Mr. Lin,

15
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:58,920
have a good sleep.

16
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:20,360
I'm actually quite tired.

17
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:23,640
I feel like a marionette.

18
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:25,080
Marriage,

19
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:26,840
getting promoted,

20
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,520
maintaining the status quo,

21
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:32,360
Every step has been planned out.

22
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:37,560
Even taking full control

23
00:01:37,960 --> 00:01:39,360
has to wait until after marriage.

24
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,560
That's my dad's decision.

25
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:49,280
Then Liu Yaru

26
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:51,440
is indeed a good choice.

27
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,440
She...

28
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:54,720
Don't mention her.

29
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:58,040
I don't feel it at all.

30
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:00,840
I don't want

31
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:03,760
to be manipulated.

32
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:05,120
Manipulated?

33
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,520
I thought people like you

34
00:02:08,640 --> 00:02:10,040
were born in Rome.

35
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:12,080
Rome?

36
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,960
Rome was built by someone else.

37
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,360
My mom

38
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:21,720
has been too strict with me since I was young.

39
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:23,200
I'm tired.

40
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,240
What I need now

41
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,120
is someone who can help me

42
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:29,440
take over the company as soon as possible,

43
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:30,840
not a wife

44
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:32,880
who just listens to me.

45
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:33,680
Oh,

46
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:36,160
what kind of wife do you want?

47
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:37,120
Smart,

48
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,080
skilled,

49
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,240
and not a burden.

50
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:41,320
So,

51
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:43,320
you don't want a wife,

52
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:45,400
but a partner.

53
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:45,920
Yes.

54
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:49,080
A partner who can help each other.

55
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:54,800
Then why don't you consider me?

56
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:58,600
You're quite direct.

57
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,320
Since we're all about taking what we need,

58
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:03,560
being direct isn't a bad thing, is it?

59
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,320
I have a way

60
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:06,800
to help you stabilize the situation

61
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:07,960
and take control.

62
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:10,160
And all I want is to be your wife.

63
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:13,520
I won't ask for your premarital property.

64
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:15,560
I'll just take what I deserve.

65
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:17,480
After you're in power,

66
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:19,200
I'll take my money and leave.

67
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:20,320
And you

68
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,240
can continue to be the CEO.

69
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,520
How about that?

70
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:30,080
So this is your real purpose

71
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:31,520
of getting close to me?

72
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:37,320
People die for wealth,

73
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:38,760
and birds die for food.

74
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,360
What's wrong with that?

75
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:43,400
But,

76
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,600
I was just kidding.

77
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:47,640
I'm drunk,

78
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:49,360
so I talk nonsense.

79
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:50,600
Don't mind it.

80
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,080
But,

81
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,600
if you take it seriously,

82
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:04,960
I'm always ready.

83
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,160
[Guan Tiantian,]

84
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:24,720
[who are you really?]

85
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,120
Bai Qiang.

86
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,080
Enough, Mr. Zhao.

87
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,800
Stop glaring.

88
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,720
If it weren't for Mr. Lin's order,

89
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,600
I wouldn't bother with your mess.

90
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,200
Take a look.

91
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,640
If there are no objections,

92
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:39,440
sign the settlement agreement.

93
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,200
You're so cruel

94
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:44,240
to ask for so much.

95
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,280
That's what you deserve.

96
00:04:46,280 --> 00:04:47,760
It's pointless to argue.

97
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,160
Mr. Zhao,

98
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,680
you're a smart man.

99
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:52,880
You should know what to choose.

100
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,040
Fine.

101
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,920
I'll accept it this time.

102
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:05,480
Mr. Guan,

103
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,880
thank you so much

104
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:08,080
for helping me get this far.

105
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:09,320
Let me treat you to a big meal.

106
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:10,760
I also want to thank you

107
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,720
for helping me solve a big problem.

108
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:13,880
This kind of good thing

109
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:15,160
should happen more often.

110
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,680
With this money,

111
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:18,400
I can finally catch my breath

112
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,720
and start over.

113
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,880
Don't dance on the edge of a knife.

114
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,440
Be careful not to hurt yourself.

115
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:26,720
It's better to stay away

116
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,960
from people like Zhao Zhiwei.

117
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:32,600
I know, Guan Lu.

118
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:33,800
But

119
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,560
you're right.

120
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:35,760
Women

121
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:37,280
can't always wait to be bullied.

122
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:38,560
I was

123
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:40,240
too weak and too stupid before.

124
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,720
But not anymore.

125
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:43,040
That's why

126
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,920
I'm here to learn.

127
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:46,680
Learn?

128
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:48,640
Here?

129
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:49,680
Yes.

130
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:51,480
My friend recommended this place.

131
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:52,840
She said it could teach us

132
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:54,440
how to meet people

133
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:55,640
of a higher class,

134
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:57,200
how to protect ourselves,

135
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,840
and how to use the rules

136
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:00,240
to get what we want.

137
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:01,960
I don't want to be that Bai Qiang anymore,

138
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:03,120
who just gets beaten up

139
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,040
and waits for someone else to save her.

140
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,720
I want to be like you,

141
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:07,880
both beautiful

142
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:08,720
and strong,

143
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:10,280
playing those self-righteous men

144
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,640
like a fiddle.

145
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:14,400
Excuse me,

146
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,080
sorry to interrupt.

147
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:19,320
You go in first.

148
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,760
I'll have a word with this lady.

149
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,040
May I ask,

150
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,040
do you know this person?

151
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:37,640
No, I don't.

152
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,000
Then,

153
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,440
do you have any impression

154
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:42,520
of the name Wang Jiming?

155
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,800
I'm sorry, ma'am,

156
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:46,080
I don't know anyone you mentioned.

157
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:48,360
You are Xiaoyu, right?

158
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:51,480
I'm sorry.

159
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:53,600
If you keep bothering me,

160
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:54,920
I'll call the police.

161
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,920
Zhao Zhiwei's matter has been resolved.

162
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:07,440
His project

163
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,640
can continue to be promoted.

164
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:13,760
This Guan Lu

165
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:14,920
is quite capable.

166
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,400
Jiming,

167
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,400
you've found a good helper.

168
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:21,080
Bro,

169
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,920
you haven't heard that

170
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:24,960
Guan Lu is more effective

171
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:26,240
than some vice presidents

172
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:28,200
in the company now.

173
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:33,920
There is a problem with the flow of funds.

174
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:35,880
The relevant materials are here.

175
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,240
Director Liu, you can have a look.

176
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,880
What do you mean, Lin Jiming?

177
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:54,080
Are you trying to frame me?

178
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,640
I'm not against you.

179
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:56,840
You need to

180
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:59,040
explain the whole thing.

181
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:00,720
Well,

182
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:01,240
bro,

183
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,080
calm down.

184
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:03,920
Jiming

185
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,080
is just doing his job.

186
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,600
Maybe

187
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:07,960
it's Guan Yu's way

188
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,800
of making a name

189
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:10,920
for himself

190
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:12,280
in the new position.

191
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:13,280
It's just business.

192
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:14,720
Please understand.

193
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:15,880
Liu Yaru,

194
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,160
the handover of the audit department

195
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,600
hasn't been completed yet.

196
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,360
You're already starting to care

197
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,280
about the specific business.

198
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,360
It's just a matter of time.

199
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:25,040
I just don't want to be like someone,

200
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:26,880
using the name of work

201
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,880
to get rid of rivals.

202
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,160
Auntie Wen.

203
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:38,960
Director Wen.

204
00:08:42,680 --> 00:08:43,160
Mom.

205
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:47,680
Yaru,

206
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:49,040
you go out for a while.

207
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,240
OK.

208
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,160
Ah.

209
00:08:58,920 --> 00:09:00,760
You can't hold your temper for a little thing.

210
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:02,120
What a shame!

211
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:04,440
Jiming

212
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:05,920
Come out.

213
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:17,000
Our Lin Group has a solid foundation

214
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,120
for so many years.

215
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:20,360
Do you know why we have to

216
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:22,240
go public now?

217
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:23,720
You said

218
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:27,080
this is to help me take over the company

219
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,200
and complete the power transition.

220
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:30,000
That's right.

221
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,120
The key is,

222
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,680
during the process of going public,

223
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:34,160
we should get rid of

224
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:35,240
all the obstacles,

225
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:37,560
and hold on

226
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:39,320
to all the things

227
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:40,720
we should hold.

228
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:41,960
But,

229
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:44,000
you were too hasty.

230
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:46,840
Why did you have to go after Liu Yaping?

231
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:48,680
He's the biggest obstacle.

232
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:51,080
Ever since he inherited his father's shares,

233
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,760
he's been targeting me.

234
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,240
Keeping him around

235
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:56,240
means I can't truly take control.

236
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:58,160
You're still so impatient.

237
00:09:58,640 --> 00:09:59,760
Hitting without killing

238
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,360
is the way to control people.

239
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:03,040
If Liu Yaping falls,

240
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:04,960
his faction

241
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:07,640
will be like a headless fly,

242
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,840
running around wildly,

243
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,440
which will be more troublesome.

244
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:12,520
Keeping him in this position

245
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,400
is the only way to make his faction

246
00:10:16,160 --> 00:10:17,800
obey.

247
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,320
You must make it realistic.

248
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:21,240
Understood, Chairman Liu.

249
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:29,120
So I have to endure it all,

250
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:31,040
even if he hinders me at every turn

251
00:10:31,920 --> 00:10:32,840
and treats me like a puppet.

252
00:10:33,280 --> 00:10:35,720
I must follow every step you've set.

253
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,120
That's right.

254
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:38,680
I personally

255
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:40,720
paved the way for you.

256
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:43,040
You don't have the luxury to make mistakes.

257
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:44,720
Messing with the Liu family

258
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:46,440
is a wrong move.

259
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,760
The Liu family can provide you with

260
00:10:48,760 --> 00:10:50,760
the auditing endorsement and network you need.

261
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,440
Such a marriage

262
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:54,400
is what has value.

263
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:57,080
Keeping Liu Yaru on board

264
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:58,640
is your only

265
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:00,520
correct choice now.

266
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:02,560
Mom,

267
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:03,800
I've said I don't like it.

268
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:05,720
I'm not asking for your opinion.

269
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:17,880
Guan Law Firm is really everywhere.

270
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:20,040
You just finished stirring up trouble with my brother,

271
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,920
and now you're in a hurry to go up

272
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:23,160
and show off to Jiming.

273
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,880
You're really efficient.

274
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,720
I solve problems for the company,

275
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:29,000
so I naturally appear where needed.

276
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,680
Unlike some people

277
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:32,200
who only know how to create problems.

278
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:34,960
Create problems?

279
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:36,640
Guan Liangliang,

280
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:39,240
you're the one who sowed discord in front of my brother,

281
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,680
hinting at his unclear accounts.

282
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:42,240
You call this solving problems?

283
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:43,640
This is clearly

284
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:44,960
stirring up trouble and muddying the waters.

285
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:46,280
Data is objective.

286
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:48,320
If Mr. Liu feels offended,

287
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:51,000
he should reflect on the process itself,

288
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:53,360
not question the person who uncovered the issue.

289
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,640
Or,

290
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:56,400
do you also think

291
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,920
the flow of that fund

292
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:59,320
is questionable?

293
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:00,320
You...

294
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:04,880
Guan Tiantian,

295
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:07,480
stop pretending to be so noble in front of me.

296
00:12:07,760 --> 00:12:08,680
Don't think

297
00:12:08,680 --> 00:12:10,880
I don't know your plans.

